      "number": 2080,
      "text": "or any other substance you think is harder[44] to bring back to life.” They will then say, “Who will bring us back [to life]?” Say, “The One Who created you the first time.” They will shake their heads[45] at you and say, “When will that be?” Say, “Perhaps it is soon.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
