      "hizbQuarter": 115,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2081,
      "text": "On the Day when He calls you, you will respond by praising Him, thinking that you had not stayed [on earth] except for a little while.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 287,
      "ruku": 244,
      "hizbQuarter": 115,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2082,
      "text": "Tell My slaves that they should say what is best[46], for Satan sows discord among them. Indeed, Satan is a sworn enemy to mankind.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 287,
      "ruku": 245,
      "hizbQuarter": 115,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2083,
      "text": "Your Lord knows you best: if He wills, He will have mercy on you; or if He wills, He will punish you. We have not sent you [O Prophet] to be in charge of them[47].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 287,
      "ruku": 245,
      "hizbQuarter": 115,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2084,
      "text": "Your Lord knows best all those in the heavens and on earth[48]. We have surely favored some prophets over others, and We gave David the Psalms[49].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 287,
      "ruku": 245,
      "hizbQuarter": 115,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2085,
      "text": "Say, “Call upon those whom you claimed [to be gods] besides Him; they have no power to remove harm or avert it from you.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 287,
      "ruku": 245,
      "hizbQuarter": 115,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2086,
      "text": "Those whom they call upon seek means of nearness to their Lord, each trying to become closer, hoping for His Mercy and fearing His punishment[50]. Indeed, the punishment of your Lord is fearsome.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 57,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 287,
      "ruku": 245,
      "hizbQuarter": 115,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2087,
      "text": "There is no [disbelieving] town except that We will destroy it before the Day of Resurrection or punish it severely[51]. This is written in the Record[52].",
